class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/fse-2025/fse-2025-research-papers/77/Medusa-A-Framework-for-Collaborative-Development-of-Foundation-Models-with-Automated\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-601c213a-e388-4bb7-a2bc-062664033508').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
